<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>
<div class="px-0 py-0 my-0 text-center hero-graphic">
    <div class="py-5 px-4 transparent-container">
        <img class="d-block mx-auto mb-4" src="/res/images/logo.jpeg" alt="" width="72" height="72">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">The Woodlands Latin Dance</h1>
        <div class="col-lg-6 mx-auto">
          <p class="lead mb-4">Dance with passion 🔥, connect with culture 🎊 at The Woodlands Latin Dance</p>
          <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-sm-flex justify-content-sm-center">
            <a href="" type="button" class="btn btn-success btn-lg px-4 gap-3">Join our Newsletter!</a>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="px-4 py-5 my-0" id="schedule-section">
    <div class="container-900px mx-auto">
        <h1 class="mx-auto text-center display-4">Schedule</h1>
        <p class="lead">
            Classes are held weekly, four times a month, and follow a progressive structure. Each week 
            builds on the previous one, ensuring steady improvement. At the end of the four-week cycle, 
            the series resets, making it easy to join at any time and start fresh.
        </p>
    </div>
    

    </p>
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-around container-900px mx-auto">
      <div class="card" style="width: 25rem;">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">BACHATA LEVEL 1</h5>
          <p class="card-text">
              This class will guide you step-by-step through the basics of Bachata, focusing on fundamental 
              footwork, rhythm, and connection. Come as you are—no partner or experience required!
          </p>
          <p>📅 DAYS: <strong>Thursday</strong></p>
          <p><strong>January: </strong> 9th, 16th, 23rd, 30th</p>
          <p>⏰ TIME: <strong>8 PM</strong></p>
          <p>📌 LOCATION: <strong>25323 I-45, Spring, TX 77380</strong></p>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-success">RSVP for next session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="width: 25rem;">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title">BACHATA LEVEL 2</h5>
          <p class="card-text">
            In this class, a basic understanding of Bachata fundamentals (covered in Bachata Level 1) is expected. 
            This is a course that builds on those foundational moves, introducing more complex patterns 
            and techniques. No partner is needed to join!
          </p>
          <p>📅 DAY: <strong>TBD</strong></p>
          <p><strong>February: </strong> TBD</p>
          <p>⏰ TIME: <strong>TBD</strong></p>
          <p>📌 LOCATION: <strong>25323 I-45, Spring, TX 77380</strong></p>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-success">RSVP for next session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="px-4 py-5 my-0 pricing-container" id="pricing-section">
  <div class="container-900px mx-auto">
      <h1 class="mx-auto text-center display-4">Pricing</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="d-flex justify-content-around container-900px mx-auto">
    <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Walk-Ins - $20</h5>
        <p class="card-text">
            Pay as you go! One time, passing by? Just came to check it out? Of course, join us. 
        </p>
        <p></p>
        <p><strong>💵Payment methods:</strong> Payment is handle on site (cash or zelle)</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-success">Join Newsletter</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Pay for the Month - $60</h5>
        <p class="card-text">
          This includes all sessions (4 classes) in a month for the class you choose. Check out our classes above👆🏻.
        </p>
        <p><strong>💵Payment methods:</strong> Payment is handle on site (cash or zelle)</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-success">Join Newsletter</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="width: 18rem;">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Monthly Unlimited - $100</h5>
        <p class="card-text">
          For the more dedicated dancers. This package allows you to take any of the classes we offer throughout the month. Check out our classes above👆🏻.
        </p>
        <p><strong>💵Payment methods:</strong> Payment is handle on site (cash or zelle)</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-success">Join Newsletter</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="px-4 py-5 my-0 faqs-container" id="faqs-section">
  <div class="container-900px mx-auto">
      <h1 class="mx-auto text-center display-4">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="container-900px mx-auto">
      <div class="question-shadow p-2">
        <a class="question" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#q1" role="button", aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="q1">🕺🏻 Can I... just show up?</a>
        <div class="collapse" id="q1">
          <p class="">Absolutely! check out our schedule and come to the class of your choosing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="question-shadow p-2">
        <a class="question" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#q2" role="button", aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="q1">💃🏻 What do I wear?</a>
        <div class="collapse" id="q2">
          <p class="">Atheltic clothes that allow full range of motion and make you feel confortable. Well-fitting sneakers or flats are just fine.</p>
          <p>Dance shoes or heels are an investment so let's get you started with dancing before you get your own dancing pair.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="question-shadow p-2">
        <a class="question" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#q3" role="button", aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="q3">🕺🏻 Do I need a partner?</a>
        <div class="collapse" id="q3">
          <p class="">No partner is required for any of the classes. We will be rotating leads and follows throughout the class so that everybody has a chance to try the moves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="question-shadow p-2">
        <a class="question" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#q4" role="button", aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="q4">💃🏻 How do I register for classes?</a>
        <div class="collapse" id="q4">
          <p class="">Show up and we will take care of you at the door.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</div>